wPlanTakers":true,"VendorIsRegistered":false,"VendorHasBidInProgress":false,"VendorHasMultipleActiveSubmissions":false,"FirstSubmissionId":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","ShowSubmitOnline":true,"ShowRegisterAsPlanTaker":true,"AllowBidQuestionSubmission":true,"OnlyRegisteredPlantakersCanSubmitQuestions":true,"IncludeSeconds":false,"TimeZoneLabel":" (PDT)","IsEmployee":false},{"Id":"aa352f3d-b8db-47e0-a80a-7d59f6d24662","Title":"CA-7026-3487-3345-3355 - Roadworks on Marine \u0026 Broadway","Scope":"Public","Status":"Open","Description":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ci\u003eOwner\u003c/i\u003e invites tenders for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cu\u003eThe \u003c/u\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003eWorks\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cu\u003e shall include but are not limited to 5,785 metric tonnes of roadway asphalt, 1,905 square meters of full depth milling, 2,295 square meters of reshaping, 30,885 square meters of surface milling, 560 lineal meters of concrete curb and gutter, 830 square meters of concrete sidewalk and driveway crossings, 170 square meters of concrete truck apron, 60 tonnes of asphalt multi-use pathway, 860 metric tonnes of gravel, traffic islands, landscaping, restoration, pavement markings, signage, adjustments, drainage, traffic signals, and streetlighting.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cu\u003eThe performance of the \u003c/u\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cu\u003eWorks\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cu\u003e shall be along the following roadways:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cu\u003eMarine Way: Market Crossing to Byrne Road;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cu\u003eByrne Road: Marine Way to Southridge Drive;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cu\u003eBroadway: Gaglardi Way to North Road;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cu\u003eMarine Way and Market Crossing Intersection;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cu\u003eMarine Way and Byrne Road Intersection;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cu\u003eCanada Way and Norland Ave. Intersection;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cu\u003eCanada Way and Ledger Ave. Intersection;\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cu\u003eCanada Way and Elwell Street Intersection.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003eThis tender is being issued electronically through the on-line bidding system at\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://burnaby.bidsandtenders.ca\"\u003ehttps://burnaby.bidsandtenders.ca\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;where Pre-Qualified contractors for the Area of Specialization of Roads – 2.0 may download\u0026nbsp;the tender documents directly from the aforementioned website, as per Request for Pre-Qualification (RFQ) #70-05-25 Pre-Qualification for Construction Services (Engineering Capital Works). \u0026nbsp;No registration tracking or other recording of tender document holder will be performed by the \u003ci\u003eOwner\u003c/i\u003e. All addenda, amendments or further information will be published through\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://burnaby.bidsandtenders.ca\"\u003ehttps://burnaby.bidsandtenders.ca\u003c/a\u003e. \u0026nbsp;It is the sole responsibility of the tenderer to monitor the website regularly to check for updates. \u0026nbsp;The tenderer is advised that the \u003ci\u003eOwner\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003eor\u003ci\u003e Contract Administrator\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003ereserves the right to not respond to enquiries received within four (4) \u003ci\u003eDays\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003eof the \u003ci\u003eTender Closing Date\u003c/i\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eOnly the following Pre-Qualified General Contactors will be invited to tender this project:\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cfigure class=\"table\" style=\"width:533.0pt;\"\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color:#F2F2F2;padding:0in 5.4pt;width